The bug was caused by improper error handling in the `CoordUtils.java` file, where the code was designed to skip certain errors (specifically `ErrorCode.E0605`) without throwing an exception. This could lead to situations where critical errors were not reported, causing the test case `TestCoordRerunXCommand.testCoordRerunDateNeg` to fail to validate the correct behavior of the coordination commands.

