if (e.getErrorCode() == ErrorCode.E0605) {
    XLog.getLog(CoordUtils.class).info("No action for nominal time:" + s + ". Skipping over");
}
```
Reason:
This code snippet improperly handles the error by logging an informational message and skipping over the exception when the error code is `E0605`. As a result, critical errors that should trigger a failure in the test case `TestCoordRerunXCommand.testCoordRerunDateNeg` are ignored, preventing proper validation of the coordination commands.

The code statements that fix the bug are:
